# GraphQL Endpoint Configuration
# 
# For Android Emulator, use: http://10.0.2.2:4000/graphql
# For iOS Simulator, use: http://localhost:4000/graphql
# For Physical Device, use your computer's IP address: http://192.168.x.x:4000/graphql
#
# To find your IP address:
# - Windows: Open Command Prompt and run: ipconfig
# - macOS/Linux: Open Terminal and run: ifconfig or ip addr show
#
GRAPHQL_ENDPOINT=http://10.0.2.2:4000/graphql
